{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-rules-syntax","title":"路由规则 DSL 语法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/chat-platform-routing/routing-rules-syntax","wordCount":1266,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"路由规则-dsl-语法\">路由规则 DSL 语法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>5 级 lookup 的优先级架构已经在 <a href=\"../../modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/five-level-routing-lookup\"><code>../../2_modules-deep/5_multi-tenant-personas/1_five-level-routing-lookup.md</code></a> 讲清。本篇换一个视角——从&quot;管理员&quot;的角度，看怎么把一条业务诉求（&quot;我希望 DM 都走默认 persona、incident-room 走 on-call&quot;）写成 YAML / JSON 规则文件。重点是 DSL 的字段语义、guard 条件、fallback 链、四种最常见的场景模板。规则文件 OpenClaw 启动时静态校验、运行时热加载。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  CFG[&quot;YAML 规则文件&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;Parser&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; VAL[&quot;Validator: 类型/正则/冲突检测&quot;]&#10;  VAL --&gt; CMP[&quot;Compiled rule table&quot;]&#10;  IN[&quot;Inbound Message&quot;] --&gt; CMP&#10;  CMP --&gt; L1[&quot;peer match&quot;]&#10;  CMP --&gt; L2[&quot;parent match&quot;]&#10;  CMP --&gt; L3[&quot;roles match&quot;]&#10;  CMP --&gt; L4[&quot;account match&quot;]&#10;  CMP --&gt; L5[&quot;channel match&quot;]&#10;  L1 --&gt; H[&quot;Hit persona&quot;]&#10;  L2 --&gt; H&#10;  L3 --&gt; H&#10;  L4 --&gt; H&#10;  L5 --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  CFG[\"YAML 规则文件\"] --&gt; P[\"Parser\"]\n  P --&gt; VAL[\"Validator: 类型/正则/冲突检测\"]\n  VAL --&gt; CMP[\"Compiled rule table\"]\n  IN[\"Inbound Message\"] --&gt; CMP\n  CMP --&gt; L1[\"peer match\"]\n  CMP --&gt; L2[\"parent match\"]\n  CMP --&gt; L3[\"roles match\"]\n  CMP --&gt; L4[\"account match\"]\n  CMP --&gt; L5[\"channel match\"]\n  L1 --&gt; H[\"Hit persona\"]\n  L2 --&gt; H\n  L3 --&gt; H\n  L4 --&gt; H\n  L5 --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DSL 块</th>\n<th>对应 lookup 级别</th>\n<th>典型条数</th>\n<th>文件大小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>peer_rules</code></td>\n<td>1 peer</td>\n<td>5-20</td>\n<td>&lt; 2KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>parent_rules</code></td>\n<td>2 parent</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>2-5KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>role_rules</code></td>\n<td>3 guild/roles</td>\n<td>5-15</td>\n<td>&lt; 2KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>account_rules</code></td>\n<td>4 account</td>\n<td>1-3</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>channel_rules</code></td>\n<td>5 channel</td>\n<td>50-200</td>\n<td>5-15KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fallback</code></td>\n<td>6 fallback</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5KB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"yaml-json-双-schema\">YAML / JSON 双 schema</h2><p>OpenClaw 的规则文件支持 YAML（默认推荐）与 JSON 两种 schema，语义等价。YAML 更适合手写——人类读 / 写 / git diff 都更舒服；JSON 适合程序生成（例如 admin UI 导出）。两种 schema 共用同一份 JSON Schema 校验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# routing.yaml — 推荐手写格式&#10;version: &#39;1&#39;&#10;peer_rules:&#10;  - peer_id: &#39;ou_alice_xxx&#39;&#10;    platform: &#39;lark&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_bytedance&#39;&#10;    audit: true&#10;parent_rules:&#10;  - parent_id: &#39;workspace_bytedance&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_bytedance&#39;&#10;    inherit_to_children: true&#10;fallback:&#10;  persona: &#39;personal_default&#39;&#10;  warn_on_use: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># routing.yaml — 推荐手写格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ou_alice_xxx'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">parent_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">parent_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'workspace_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    inherit_to_children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  warn_on_use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;peer_rules&quot;: [{ &quot;peer_id&quot;: &quot;ou_alice_xxx&quot;, &quot;platform&quot;: &quot;lark&quot;, &quot;persona&quot;: &quot;dev_bytedance&quot;, &quot;audit&quot;: true }],&#10;  &quot;fallback&quot;: { &quot;persona&quot;: &quot;personal_default&quot;, &quot;warn_on_use&quot;: true }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"peer_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"peer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ou_alice_xxx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lark\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dev_bytedance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"audit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fallback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"persona\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"personal_default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"warn_on_use\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OpenClaw 启动时验证：unknown 字段拒绝（防 typo）、persona 必须在 personas catalog 中已定义、字段类型严格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"guard-条件-sender-channel-regex\">guard 条件：sender / channel / regex</h2><p>每条规则可以挂一组 <code>guard</code> 条件作为额外过滤。命中 lookup 级别后还要 guard 都通过才算 hit。guard 支持三种主要形态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"peer_rules:&#10;  - peer_id: &#39;ou_alice_xxx&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_bytedance&#39;&#10;    guard:&#10;      sender_role_in: [&#39;leader&#39;, &#39;tech_lead&#39;] # 仅特定角色发的消息&#10;      channel_kind: &#39;im&#39; # 仅在 DM&#10;      text_regex: &#39;^/deploy &#39; # 命令前缀匹配&#10;      time_window:&#10;        start: &#39;09:00&#39;&#10;        end: &#39;19:00&#39;&#10;        tz: &#39;Asia/Shanghai&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ou_alice_xxx'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      sender_role_in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'leader'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tech_lead'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅特定角色发的消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      channel_kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'im'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 仅在 DM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      text_regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^/deploy '</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 命令前缀匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      time_window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'09:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'19:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Asia/Shanghai'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>guard 字段</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>失败行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sender_role_in</code></td>\n<td>发送者必须在给定角色集合</td>\n<td>跳到下一规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>channel_kind</code></td>\n<td>channel 类型必须匹配（im/group/channel）</td>\n<td>跳到下一规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>text_regex</code></td>\n<td>消息文本正则匹配</td>\n<td>跳到下一规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>time_window</code></td>\n<td>消息时间在窗口内（带时区）</td>\n<td>跳到下一规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>platform</code></td>\n<td>消息所在平台必须匹配</td>\n<td>跳到下一规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>guard 失败时不是&quot;路由失败&quot;，而是<strong>继续在同 lookup 级别向后看下一条规则</strong>——这与 lookup 级别本身的优先级机制正交。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fallback-链-多级兜底\">fallback 链：多级兜底</h2><p>OpenClaw 支持把 <code>fallback</code> 写成一条链而不是单一 persona——按顺序尝试，前者拒绝才退到后者：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"fallback:&#10;  chain:&#10;    - condition: &#39;channel_kind == &quot;im&quot;&#39;&#10;      persona: &#39;personal_dm&#39;&#10;    - condition: &#39;sender_external == true&#39;&#10;      persona: &#39;public_safe&#39;&#10;    - default: true&#10;      persona: &#39;personal_default&#39;&#10;  warn_on_use: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  chain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel_kind == \"im\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal_dm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sender_external == true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'public_safe'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  warn_on_use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>链元素</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>condition</code> 表达式</td>\n<td>表达式 true 才命中</td>\n<td>按 message 属性分流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>default: true</code></td>\n<td>链尾，任何前面未命中都走此</td>\n<td>全局兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>fallback 链让&quot;按 channel kind 区分默认 persona&quot;成为可能——不需要在 <code>channel_rules</code> 里枚举所有 channel id。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景模板-一-dm-默认-persona\">场景模板（一）：DM 默认 persona</h2><p>最常见的需求：&quot;1:1 私聊都用一个默认 persona，不写每个 peer&quot;。用 fallback 链 + channel kind guard 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"fallback:&#10;  chain:&#10;    - condition: &#39;channel_kind == &quot;im&quot;&#39;&#10;      persona: &#39;dm_default&#39;&#10;    - default: true&#10;      persona: &#39;personal_default&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  chain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel_kind == \"im\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dm_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal_default'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>或者更显式——给 IM 写专门的 channel rule（但只写一条通配）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"channel_rules:&#10;  - channel_kind: &#39;im&#39; # 所有 DM&#10;    persona: &#39;dm_default&#39;&#10;    priority: 100\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'im'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 所有 DM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dm_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种写法等价；维护者偏好 fallback chain 写法因为它更 explicit &quot;this is the catch-all&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景模板-二-channel-keyword-触发-persona\">场景模板（二）：channel keyword 触发 persona</h2><p>需求：&quot;某 channel 在消息以 <code>/oncall</code> 开头时切换到 oncall persona，其他时候保持默认&quot;。用 channel rule + text_regex guard：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"channel_rules:&#10;  - channel_id: &#39;lark_oc_incidents&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;oncall_engineer&#39;&#10;    guard:&#10;      text_regex: &#39;^/oncall &#39;&#10;    priority: 10&#10;  - channel_id: &#39;lark_oc_incidents&#39; # 同 channel 默认&#10;    persona: &#39;engineer_default&#39;&#10;    priority: 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_oc_incidents'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'oncall_engineer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      text_regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^/oncall '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_oc_incidents'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 同 channel 默认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'engineer_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span></code></pre></div><p>priority 数字小者先匹配——<code>/oncall</code> 前缀命中 oncall persona，其他流量走 engineer_default。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景模板-三-sender-role-决定-persona\">场景模板（三）：sender role 决定 persona</h2><p>需求：&quot;来自 admin 的所有消息走 ops persona、外部承包商走受限 persona&quot;。这是 role-based 路由的典型场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"role_rules:&#10;  - role_id: &#39;lark_admin&#39;&#10;    platform: &#39;lark&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;ops_admin&#39;&#10;    audit: true&#10;  - role_id: &#39;lark_external_contractor&#39;&#10;    platform: &#39;lark&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_external_safe&#39;&#10;    guard:&#10;      channel_kind_in: [&#39;im&#39;, &#39;group&#39;] # 不在公共频道触发\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_admin'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ops_admin'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_external_contractor'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_external_safe'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      channel_kind_in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'im'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不在公共频道触发</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>role_id</code> 必须带平台前缀（如 <code>lark_*</code> / <code>slack_*</code>）避免跨平台同名冲突——这是 multi-platform OpenClaw 部署的高频陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景模板-四-time-of-day-on-call\">场景模板（四）：time-of-day on-call</h2><p>需求：&quot;工作时间外的 incident-room 消息走 on-call persona、工作时间内走 engineer persona&quot;。time_window guard 直接表达：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"channel_rules:&#10;  - channel_id: &#39;lark_oc_incidents&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;oncall_after_hours&#39;&#10;    guard:&#10;      time_window:&#10;        start: &#39;19:00&#39;&#10;        end: &#39;09:00&#39; # 跨午夜&#10;        tz: &#39;Asia/Shanghai&#39;&#10;    priority: 5&#10;  - channel_id: &#39;lark_oc_incidents&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;engineer_default&#39;&#10;    priority: 50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_oc_incidents'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'oncall_after_hours'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      time_window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'19:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'09:00'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 跨午夜</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Asia/Shanghai'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_oc_incidents'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'engineer_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OpenClaw 在 evaluator 里把&quot;跨午夜&quot;区间正确处理——start &gt; end 视为&quot;夜间窗口&quot;。时区固定到规则配置而不是 server 时区，便于跨地区部署。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-multi-tenant-5-level-lookup-的协议关系\">与 multi-tenant 5-level lookup 的协议关系</h2><p>本篇 DSL 是 5 级 lookup 在<strong>配置层</strong>的具体语法，背后的执行模型完全相同——详见 <a href=\"../../modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/five-level-routing-lookup\"><code>../../2_modules-deep/5_multi-tenant-personas/1_five-level-routing-lookup.md</code></a>。两篇关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>本篇</th>\n<th>modules-deep 篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抽象层</td>\n<td>配置 DSL（怎么写）</td>\n<td>执行模型（怎么 lookup）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读者</td>\n<td>部署 OpenClaw 的 admin</td>\n<td>想理解协议的开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关注点</td>\n<td>YAML 字段 / guard / 场景</td>\n<td>命中优先级 / 冲突检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>persona 写错被静默忽略</strong>：未在 personas catalog 注册的 persona 名会导致整条规则被跳过——OpenClaw 启动校验已经检测，但 reload 时若 personas 文件先变 OpenClaw 可能 race。reload 顺序：先 personas、再 routing。</li>\n<li><strong>guard 用错运算符</strong>：<code>sender_role_in</code> 接列表，写成单字符串会报 schema error；<code>channel_kind</code> 接单值，写列表用 <code>channel_kind_in</code>。两者名称区分清楚。</li>\n<li><strong>time_window 没写时区</strong>：默认 UTC——admin 在中国常忘改，导致工作时间窗口错位 8 小时。强烈建议每条 time_window 显式 <code>tz</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>fallback chain default 缺失</strong>：所有 condition 都不命中时静默不路由——消息丢失。<code>default: true</code> 必须存在。</li>\n<li><strong>正则没 anchored</strong>：<code>text_regex: &#39;/deploy &#39;</code> 不带 <code>^</code> 匹配子串，会被 spam 文本意外触发。命令型规则用 <code>^/cmd</code> 显式 anchor。</li>\n<li><strong>跨平台 role_id 同名冲突</strong>：飞书 / Slack 的 <code>moderator</code> role id 字符串相同但语义不同。必须 platform 前缀。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>routing DSL 把 5 级 lookup 的配置语法标准化为 YAML / JSON 两种 schema，外加一组 guard（sender_role / channel_kind / text_regex / time_window / platform）做二级过滤。fallback 链让&quot;按 message 属性分流到不同默认 persona&quot;成为可能，比硬编码 channel rule 更简洁。四种场景模板（DM 默认 / channel 关键字 / sender role / time-of-day）覆盖了 90% 实际部署。下一篇讲规则命中的 persona 如何与 channel 形成 N:M 绑定、绑定如何持久化、跨设备/跨重启一致性怎么保。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路由规则 DSL 语法","id":"路由规则-dsl-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"YAML / JSON 双 schema","id":"yaml-json-双-schema"},{"level":2,"text":"guard 条件：sender / channel / regex","id":"guard-条件-sender-channel-regex"},{"level":2,"text":"fallback 链：多级兜底","id":"fallback-链-多级兜底"},{"level":2,"text":"场景模板（一）：DM 默认 persona","id":"场景模板-一-dm-默认-persona"},{"level":2,"text":"场景模板（二）：channel keyword 触发 persona","id":"场景模板-二-channel-keyword-触发-persona"},{"level":2,"text":"场景模板（三）：sender role 决定 persona","id":"场景模板-三-sender-role-决定-persona"},{"level":2,"text":"场景模板（四）：time-of-day on-call","id":"场景模板-四-time-of-day-on-call"},{"level":2,"text":"与 multi-tenant 5-level lookup 的协议关系","id":"与-multi-tenant-5-level-lookup-的协议关系"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"主流 chat platform 适配清单","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/chat-platform-routing/platform-adapter-catalog"},"next":{"title":"Personas 与 channel 的绑定语义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/chat-platform-routing/personas-channel-binding"}}